body:

Will is studying Integrated Sciences and Public Policy, with a strong personal interest in advancing healthcare in rural and resource-limited settings. Outside the Lab, Will enjoys a variety of outdoor activities: skiing, hiking, biking, climbing, and running for the CMS XC and Track teams.
